	  7H50 C 2 A_TakeInventory("VivifyCycle2")
	  7H50 CB 2
	  7H50 BAAAA 4 A_GiveInventory("DecoyEnergyAmmo", 2)
	  goto Ready2
	 Fire51Suplex:
